            "title": "China files WTO dispute against $200B U.S. tariff list - POLITICO",
            "snippets": [
              "# China files WTO dispute against $200B U.S. tariff list\nAmerican and Chinese flags are pictured. | AP Photo\n\nChina has quickly retaliated against that initial $34 billion tariff list by imposing reciprocal penalties on a similar value of U.S. imports.",
              "China announced on Monday that it would mount a World Trade Organization challenge against the Trump administration’s proposal to hit $200 billion worth of Chinese imports with a new round of tariffs, according to a one-line release the Ministry of Commerce posted to its website",
